      en: ["Located in a geologically active zone of the East African Rift.", "A traditional site for the seasonal migration of nomads.", "Vegetation is dominated by acacias and thorny bushes.", "Water supply is primarily sourced from deep traditional wells.", "The social structure is based on the traditional clan system.", "Serves as an important landmark in the Djiboutian semi-desert."],
